# Derived from go.work and every module's go.sum. Each module's own go.sum is
# the source of truth and CI checks it under GOWORK=off, so this file only adds
# churn. The failure mode this must not hide: `go work sync` writing hashes
# only here, leaving a per-module go.sum incomplete — guarded by the
# per-module `go mod tidy` diff check in ci.yml.
go.work.sum

# goreleaser writes dist/config.yaml BEFORE it builds, so an untracked dist/
# flips Go's vcs.modified stamp to true and every service that appends
# revision.Revision advertises a "-dirty" version from a clean release. Only
# piri/.gitignore had this.
dist/
